  "Cut to the climb": "剪到攀爬部分", "Spotter found where you leave the ground and land. Drag the ends to change it.": "Spotter 已找到你离地和落地的位置。拖动两端可以调整。", "Drag the ends to where you leave the ground and where you land.": "把两端拖到你离地和落地的位置。", "Use whole video": "用整段", "Start of the climb": "攀爬开始", "End of the climb": "攀爬结束", "Whole video": "整段视频", "Also post to Community": "同时发布到社区", "Climbers at {} see the video. Your analysis stays private.": "{}的岩友能看到视频。分析结果只有你能看到。", "Climbers at the gym see the video. Your analysis stays private.": "这个岩馆的岩友能看到视频。分析结果只有你能看到。", "In Community already. Your analysis stays private.": "已经在社区里了。分析结果只有你能看到。", "Posted to Community. Analysing…": "已发布到社区，正在分析…", "Only you can see this": "只有你能看到", "Post the video to Community. Your analysis stays private.": "把视频发布到社区。分析结果只有你能看到。", "So arm angles are off. Arm lock shows only where your arms can be seen.": "所以手臂角度不显示。锁臂只在看得清手臂的地方显示。", "Your body was in a good position, so the hard part was the next move itself. Work it out from the ground before your next try, or watch how someone who topped it did it.": "你的身体位置不错，难点在下一个动作本身。下次爬之前先在地面上想清楚，或者看看完攀的人是怎么做的。", "Your moves and pauses stayed about the same from bottom to top: you had enough left for the whole route.": "从下到上，你的动作节奏和停顿都差不多：体力够爬完整条线。", "You moved faster in the last third without pausing longer. You had energy left: the start is where to save time.": "最后三分之一你动得更快，停顿也没变长。体力还有富余：可以在开头省点时间。", "You made {}% fewer moves a minute at the top than at the start. That usually means tiring forearms, or working out the top on the wall. Shake out on a big hold before the top section.": "到顶部时每分钟的动作比开头少了 {}%。通常是前臂累了，或者在墙上琢磨顶部怎么爬。进入顶部前，找个大点甩甩手。", "Your pauses got {}× longer in the last third. That usually means tiring forearms, or working out the top on the wall. Shake out on a big hold before the top section.": "最后三分之一的停顿长了 {} 倍。通常是前臂累了，或者在墙上琢磨顶部怎么爬。进入顶部前，找个大点甩甩手。", "You slowed down near the top": "快到顶时慢了下来", "You picked up speed": "越爬越快", "A steady pace all the way": "全程节奏稳定", "Getting tired": "开始累了", "Strong finish": "收尾有力", "Steady": "稳定", "Middle": "中段", "/min": "/分钟", "{} s pauses": "停顿 {} 秒", "Nothing stands out across the whole climb. Open where you stopped, below, and compare that part with someone who topped it.": "整段攀爬没有明显的问题。打开下面「你停下的地方」，和完攀的人对比那一段。", "Arms straight in {}% of your rests, and a {} s rest on the way.": "休息时 {}% 的时间手臂伸直，途中有一次 {} 秒的休息。", "A {} s rest on the way.": "途中有一次 {} 秒的休息。", "See your best rest": "看你最好的一次休息", "See this rest": "看这次休息", "See this stretch": "看这一段", "See this move": "看这个动作", "See this pause": "看这次停顿", "At {} your {} foot moved across and your hips were back over your feet.": "{} 时你的{}脚移过去，髋部回到了脚的上方。", "Weight out to the {}": "重心偏{}", "Your centre is past your {} foot, so your hands hold you on.": "你的重心超出了{}脚，所以要靠手拉住。", "Only one foot was on, and your centre was out to the {} of it.": "只有一只脚踩着，重心偏到了它的{}边。", "Next try: before you reach, move your hips over your feet, or put a foot further {}.": "下次：伸手之前，先把髋部移到脚的上方，或者把一只脚放得更靠{}。", "{} arm bent · {}°": "{}臂弯曲 · {}°", "Arms straight · {}°": "手臂伸直 · {}°", "Arms half bent · {}°": "手臂半弯 · {}°", "{} foot up first": "先抬{}脚", "{} foot up first, to where it landed at {}": "先抬{}脚，踩到 {} 时落脚的位置", "You moved a lot side to side.": "你左右移动很多。", "A fairly straight line up.": "基本是一条直线往上。", "Arm pull": "手拉", "Legs and arms": "腿和手", "left": "左", "right": "右", "Left": "左", "Right": "右", "Get started": "开始", "40 hand and foot moves": "手脚移动 40 次", "found in Leo’s climb of Green 5.8": "来自 Leo 爬绿线 5.8 的视频",
